# Tile cache. Reproducible from the network, and large: 18 MB for one route.
routes/*/data/cache/

# Derived rasters. fetch_dem.py / fetch_sat.py rebuild these from the tile
# sources; dem.npz is 0.9-1.5 MB and the source sat.jpg 3.3 MB per route.
routes/*/data/dem.npz
routes/*/data/sat.jpg

# Build output, regenerated by `route-studio build` from data/ + route.toml.
routes/*/site/*

# ...except tianlu's, which IS the live demo. Pages can only serve what is
# committed, so the 6 MB of scene.bin + sat.jpg is the price of a link anyone
# can open. Editing a shader therefore means re-committing a 2.5 MB binary --
# accepted deliberately; every other route stays source-only.
!routes/tianlu/site/
!routes/tianlu/site/terrain.html
!routes/tianlu/site/roadbook.html
!routes/tianlu/site/scene.json
!routes/tianlu/site/scene.bin
!routes/tianlu/site/sat.jpg

__pycache__/
*.pyc
